  summary:
    "The Acts of the Apostles as history and theology; the Jerusalem community and its leaders; Stephen, the Hellenists, and the first mission beyond Judea; the admission of Gentiles and the council of Jerusalem; and what Acts, Paul, and outside sources tell us about the life, worship, and diversity of the first Christian communities.",
